<title>UK: Single Brent cargo in chains kept by BP - trade.</title>
<headline>Single Brent cargo in chains kept by BP - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The single Brent cargo to turn physical on Tuesday was kept before the five o' clock deadline by British Petroleum, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo is due to load in the May 14-16 period.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
</text>
